# Frontend source only: Vercel project Root Directory is pinta.
# The root legacy vercel.json is deliberately not uploaded.
/*
!/pinta
!/.vercelignore

# Local credentials, backups and agent/browser working files at any depth.
**/.env*
**/.deployment-backups
**/.gstack
**/.agents
**/.codex
**/.claude
**/.git
**/.vercel
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Dependencies and build output are recreated by npm ci / npm run build.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results

# Backend deployment, documentation and QA are separate from frontend hosting.
**/supabase
**/docs
**/tests
**/scripts
**/*.test.*
**/*.md
